WEBVTT

00:00:28.125 --> 00:00:31.143
I was a person where I'd go into shops

00:00:31.167 --> 00:00:33.809
and people would
convince me to buy clothes

00:00:33.833 --> 00:00:36.476
and I would just buy them
because I would feel bad

00:00:36.500 --> 00:00:38.809
and then return them later.

00:00:38.833 --> 00:00:42.351
AG: Wow, that is a whole
new level of agreeableness.

00:00:42.375 --> 00:00:45.184
GS: I just was always
afraid to kind of ask

00:00:45.208 --> 00:00:50.268
and just have the person
be angry or upset.

00:00:50.292 --> 00:00:51.809
AG: When she finished college,

00:00:51.833 --> 00:00:55.309
she was grateful to land
a great marketing job at a good company.

00:00:55.333 --> 00:00:58.684
Grace was consistently
a star performer in her department.

00:00:58.708 --> 00:01:02.393
She got promoted
five times over five years,